{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15210430","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15210430","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1521043001:1":{"text":"你们要回呼临城了吗？我还准备多待一会呢。","source_cn":"你们要回呼临城了吗？我还准备多待一会呢。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x76C99605159DE83C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"你们要回呼临城了吗？我还准备多待一会呢。","female":"你们要回呼临城了吗？我还准备多待一会呢。","variant_male_record_index":"183518","variant_female_record_index":"183519","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:2:1521043001":{"text":"你们要回呼临城了吗？我还准备多待一会呢。","source_cn":"你们要回呼临城了吗？我还准备多待一会呢。","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x76C99605159DE83C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"你们要回呼临城了吗？我还准备多待一会呢。","female":"你们要回呼临城了吗？我还准备多待一会呢。","variant_male_record_index":"183518","variant_female_record_index":"183519","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1521043002:0":{"text":"嗯！这是我第一次得到别人的认可——呃，除了我父亲和珀尔修斯之外。","source_cn":"嗯！这是我第一次得到别人的认可——呃，除了我父亲和珀尔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7911E80F7FA5A48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1521043003:0":{"text":"而且不是一个人，是很多很多士兵！他们都觉得我刚才的指挥很好！","source_cn":"而且不是一个人，是很多很多士兵！他们都觉得我刚才的指挥很好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AF5C9E13054115B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1521043004:0":{"text":"……阿邦德，我有一个问题想要问你。","source_cn":"……阿邦德，我有一个问题想要问你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B113667A